":400610101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[3193,1005],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/EQ/Inazuma_40061/Q4006101","priority":5,"questId":40061,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":400610101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":149027082,"text":"A breeze from the south blew across Watatsumi Island today — a sure sign that friends would come visit.","nextNodeIds":[400610102]},{"nodeId":400610102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1576215914,"text":"Every time you say something like this, that means things are about to get busy... for us.","nextNodeIds":[400610103]},{"nodeId":400610103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":986745770,"text":"Oh, don't say that. Haven't we had a fruitful partnership? The most fruitful sort, in fact.","nextNodeIds":[400610104]},{"nodeId":400610104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":2998451938,"text":"That said, I do have something to ask of the two of you today.","nextNodeIds":[400610105]},{"nodeId":400610105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":3618075426,"text":"It is told in my family that apart from the Watatsumi Goryou Matsuri, we also added a different set of trials. One unrelated to Watatsumi Island's survival, but instead, related to the truth.","nextNodeIds":[400610106]},{"nodeId":400610106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2272989170,"text":"Another... set of trials?","nextNodeIds":[400610107]},{"nodeId":400610107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":1390828738,"text":"Now that the island is no longer under existential threat, I would just like to tell you this. Consider it our clan's duty.","nextNodeIds":[400610108]},{"nodeId":400610108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":1258323994,"text":"You can go to the place they call the Serpent's Heart. The clues to this second set of trials is hidden there.","nextNodeIds":[400610109]},{"nodeId":400610109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3193,"speakerName":"Tsuyuko","textMapHash":2461663962,"text":"...Well, that's a relief! Guess I can safely hand this crushing responsibility on to my future daughter now.","nextNodeIds":[400610110]},{"nodeId":400610110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3336080922,"text":"...Is that how you pay respect to your ancestral mission?","nextNodeIds":[400610111]},{"nodeId":400610111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1916375698,"text":"Paimon still doesn't get you even after all this time, Tsuyuko...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4006101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["3193"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":4006102,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Investigate the Serpent's Heart during Evernight","stepDescTextMapHash":2622127052,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4006102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7227501,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUID